gacy})\\\\n \\\\n \\\\n+(defn clojure-manifest\\\\n+  \\\\\\\"The Clojure frontend's manifest. Its coverage promise changed under\\\\n+   the call-site occurrence contract C1 — every final `:application`\\\\n+   occurrence carries `:yang/call-site` in the frontend-metadata side\\\\n+   table, finalized over the post-expansion tree that executes and\\\\n+   retained beside a published module's manifest — and that promise is\\\\n+   a support claim, so the revision and the support profile name it;\\\\n+   the shared legacy profiles no longer describe this frontend.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+  []\\\\n+  (assoc (manifest :yang/clojure :clojure)\\\\n+         :yang.frontend/revision \\\\\\\"c1-1\\\\\\\"\\\\n+         :yang.frontend/support-profile :yang.clojure/c1))\\\\n+\\\\n+\\\\n (defn- clojure-lower\\\\n   [forms]\\\\n   (if (= 1 (count forms))\\\\n@@ -78,7 +92,7 @@\\\\n    returns.\\\\\\\"\\\\n   []\\\\n   (cond-> frontend/empty-catalog\\\\n-    true (frontend/install (manifest :yang/clojure :clojure)\\\\n+    true (frontend/install (clojure-manifest)\\\\n                            {:input :forms,\\\\n                             :parse identity,\\\\n                             :lower clojure-lower})\\\\ndiff --git a/src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc b/src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc\\\\nindex b0d222ca..1bb7ca84 100644\\\\n--- a/src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc\\\\n+++ b/src/cljc/yin/vm.cljc\\\\n@@ -1609,6 +1609,20 @@\\\\n                (into tuples (map (fn [[path id]] [root path id]) frontier)))))))\\\\n \\\\n \\\\n+(defn application-occurrences\\\\n+  \\\\\\\"The `[root path]` of every `:application` occurrence of the projected\\\\n+   row set `tree`: the occurrence relation joined on the row tags, with\\\\n+   no origin — a composition fixes the origin from its own side, as with\\\\n+   `occurrences`. This is the eligible-site derivation of the call-site\\\\n+   occurrence contract: one pair per place, so a shared application row\\\\n+   at two places counts twice.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+  [{:keys [rows] :as tree}]\\